[Section: 3. State-oriented decomposition]

The program separates several conceptual subsystems:

- AC;

- engine-temperature controller;

- engine state;

- traffic light / speed behavior.

Helper functions update these states.

This is useful evidence of early:

- state-based modeling;

- decomposing control logic;

- mapping inputs to outputs.

[Section: 3. State-oriented decomposition > State/control logic]

